# {{.Name}}

Campaign vault created with `yonder init --bare` (offline, no internet needed).

Folders:

- `characters/` — one folder per player character, sheet in `index.md`
- `sessions/` — session notes and recaps
- `quests/` — quest tracking
- `maps/` — battlemaps and handouts (see `assets/` for uploads)
- `assets/` — images (png/jpg, max 5MB), PDFs (max 10MB)
- `rules/` — homebrew rules packs (`yonder rules lint` checks them)
- `notes/` — everything else

Secrets: mark a page `secret: true` in frontmatter (GM + owner only).
Secret blocks use `> [!secret]-` (hidden from party, visible to page owner).
